msgstr[0] "a ďalší %d"
msgstr[1] "a ďalšie %d"
msgstr[2] "a ďalších %d"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-notices.php
msgid "Open API log"
msgstr "Otvoriť API log"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-notices.php
msgid "More than %d documents could not be created or updated in SuperFaktúra in the last 30 days."
msgstr "Viac ako %d dokladov sa za posledných 30 dní nepodarilo vytvoriť alebo aktualizovať v SuperFaktúre."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-notices.php
msgid "and more"
msgstr "a ďalšie"

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The automatic pairing URL was called without an invoice ID or secret key. SuperFaktura sends both, so the request most likely did not come from SuperFaktura."
msgstr "Adresa pre automatické párovanie bola zavolaná bez ID faktúry alebo Secret Key. SuperFaktúra posiela oboje, takže požiadavka s veľkou pravdepodobnosťou neprišla zo SuperFaktúry."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The invoice ID or secret key in the request is not valid. Check that the Secret Key in SuperFaktura settings matches the one in the plugin settings."
msgstr "ID faktúry alebo Secret Key v požiadavke nie sú platné. Skontrolujte, či je Secret Key v nastaveniach SuperFaktúry rovnaký ako v nastaveniach pluginu."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "SuperFaktura reported a payment for an invoice that does not belong to exactly one order in this shop. Either no order has it (for example an invoice issued directly in SuperFaktura, or an order in the trash), or several orders have the same invoice."
msgstr "SuperFaktúra oznámila úhradu faktúry, ktorá nepatrí práve jednej objednávke v tomto obchode. Buď ju nemá žiadna objednávka (napríklad faktúra vystavená priamo v SuperFaktúre alebo objednávka v koši), alebo rovnakú faktúru má viac objednávok."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "SuperFaktura did not return this invoice. It may have been deleted, the plugin may be connected to a different SuperFaktura account or company, or the connection to SuperFaktura failed."
msgstr "SuperFaktúra túto faktúru nevrátila. Mohla byť zmazaná, plugin môže byť pripojený k inému účtu či firme v SuperFaktúre, alebo zlyhalo spojenie so SuperFaktúrou."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "Only payments of invoices and proforma invoices mark the order as paid."
msgstr "Objednávku označí ako zaplatenú len úhrada faktúry alebo zálohovej faktúry."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The invoice is not paid or is paid only partially, so the order was not marked as paid."
msgstr "Faktúra nie je uhradená alebo je uhradená len čiastočne, preto sa objednávka neoznačila ako zaplatená."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The invoice was settled by a credit note, so the order was not marked as paid."
msgstr "Faktúra bola vyrovnaná dobropisom, preto sa objednávka neoznačila ako zaplatená."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The order was already paid, so its status was not changed. No action is needed."
msgstr "Objednávka už bola zaplatená, preto sa jej stav nezmenil. Nie je potrebné nič robiť."

#. Translators: %s Link to the setting.
#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
#, php-format
msgid "SuperFaktura reported a payment, but the order was not in any of the statuses set in %s, so it was not marked as paid. Add the status there if such orders should be marked as paid too."
msgstr "SuperFaktúra oznámila úhradu, ale objednávka nebola v žiadnom zo stavov v nastavení %s, preto sa neoznačila ako zaplatená. Ak sa majú takéto objednávky označiť ako zaplatené, pridajte tam aj tento stav."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "If the order is already paid, no action is needed."
msgstr "Ak je objednávka už zaplatená, nie je potrebné nič robiť."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php includes/class-wc-sf-settings.php
msgid "Order statuses for automatic pairing"
msgstr "Stavy objednávky pre automatické párovanie"

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The server could not connect to VIES, so the VAT number could not be verified. If this happens often, contact your hosting provider."
msgstr "Server sa nevedel spojiť so službou VIES, preto sa IČ DPH nedalo overiť. Ak sa to stáva často, kontaktujte poskytovateľa hostingu."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "VIES was temporarily unavailable, so the VAT number could not be verified."
msgstr "Služba VIES bola dočasne nedostupná, preto sa IČ DPH nedalo overiť."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "Check the API email, API key and Company ID in the plugin settings, or use the Test API connection button."
msgstr "Skontrolujte API email, API kľúč a Company ID v nastaveniach pluginu, alebo použite tlačidlo Otestovať API pripojenie."

#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
msgid "The server could not connect to SuperFaktura. If this happens often, contact your hosting provider."
msgstr "Server sa nevedel spojiť so SuperFaktúrou. Ak sa to stáva často, kontaktujte poskytovateľa hostingu."

#. Translators: %s Setting name.
#: includes/class-wc-superfaktura.php
#, php-format
msgid "The plugin stopped this request, because another request for the same document was running at the same time (setting %s). Usually the other request has already created or updated the document. If not, create or regenerate it again."
msgstr "Plugin zastavil túto požiadavku, pretože v tom istom čase prebiehala iná požiadavka pre ten istý doklad (nastavenie %s). Tá druhá požiadavka doklad zvyčajne už vytvorila alebo aktualizovala. Ak nie, vytvorte alebo pregenerujte ho znova."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-settings.php
msgid "When a payment is paired to an invoice in SuperFaktura, orders in these statuses are marked as paid. If no status is selected, paired payments do not change any order."
msgstr "Keď sa v SuperFaktúre spáruje úhrada s faktúrou, objednávky v týchto stavoch sa označia ako zaplatené. Ak nie je vybraný žiadny stav, spárované úhrady nezmenia žiadnu objednávku."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-settings.php
msgid "Announcements"
msgstr "Oznamy"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-settings.php
msgid "Download announcements about SuperFaktura and this plugin once a day. No data about your shop or customers is sent."
msgstr "Raz denne sťahovať oznamy o SuperFaktúre a tomto plugine. Neposielajú sa žiadne údaje o vašom obchode ani zákazníkoch."

