#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Connect your shop to SuperFaktúra. The setup wizard recommends settings for your payment and shipping methods, it takes about 5 minutes."
msgstr "Prepojte obchod so SuperFaktúrou. Sprievodca nastavením odporučí nastavenia pre vaše spôsoby platby a dopravy, zaberie to asi 5 minút."

