msgstr "Sprievodca nastavením"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Skip and set up manually"
msgstr "Preskočiť a nastaviť ručne"

#. translators: %d: step number.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "Step %d"
msgstr "Krok %d"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Set up invoicing for your shop"
msgstr "Nastavme fakturáciu pre váš obchod"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The wizard connects your shop to SuperFaktúra and recommends settings for your payment and shipping methods. It takes about 5 minutes. Nothing is saved until you confirm the summary at the end."
msgstr "Sprievodca prepojí obchod so SuperFaktúrou a odporučí nastavenia pre vaše spôsoby platby a dopravy. Trvá to asi 5 minút. Nič sa neuloží, kým na konci nepotvrdíte zhrnutie."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Connection."
msgstr "Pripojenie."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "E-mail and API key from SuperFaktúra, choice of company."
msgstr "E-mail a API kľúč zo SuperFaktúry, výber firmy."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Documents."
msgstr "Doklady."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Checkout and emails."
msgstr "Pokladňa a e-maily."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Company details at checkout, VAT number, OSS and the invoice in emails."
msgstr "Údaje firmy v pokladni, IČ DPH, OSS a faktúra v e-mailoch."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "You can leave at any time, nothing is saved until the end."
msgstr "Sprievodcu môžete kedykoľvek opustiť, do konca sa nič neuloží."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Začať"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Slovakia"
msgstr "Slovensko"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Czech Republic"
msgstr "Česko"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Austria"
msgstr "Rakúsko"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Connection to SuperFaktúra"
msgstr "Pripojenie k SuperFaktúre"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The plugin connects to your account through the API. You can find the details in SuperFaktúra under Tools > API."
msgstr "Plugin sa k vášmu účtu pripája cez API. Údaje nájdete v SuperFaktúre v časti Nástroje > API."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Account"
msgstr "Účet"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Where is your SuperFaktúra account?"
msgstr "Kde máte účet v SuperFaktúre?"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "API e-mail"
msgstr "API e-mail"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API kľúč"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Saved key stays unchanged"
msgstr "Uložený kľúč ostane bez zmeny"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "For testing only. Use a test account from sandbox.superfaktura.sk or sandbox.superfaktura.cz, documents are not created in your real account."
msgstr "Len na skúšanie. Použite testovací účet zo sandbox.superfaktura.sk alebo sandbox.superfaktura.cz, doklady nevznikajú vo vašom ostrom účte."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Needed when the account has several companies and its default company has no active subscription. You can find it in SuperFaktúra under Tools > API, in the company you want to use."
msgstr "Potrebné, ak má účet viac firiem a jeho predvolená firma nemá aktívne predplatné. Nájdete ho v SuperFaktúre v časti Nástroje > API vo firme, ktorú chcete použiť."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Verify connection"
msgstr "Overiť pripojenie"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Connected to SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Pripojené k SuperFaktúre."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Choose the company that should receive the documents from this shop."
msgstr "Vyberte firmu, do ktorej majú prichádzať doklady z tohto obchodu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Company"
msgstr "Firma"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "If you run several shops in different companies, each shop uses its own company."
msgstr "Ak máte viac eshopov v rôznych firmách, každý eshop používa svoju firmu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Verify the connection to continue."
msgstr "Pokračovať môžete po overení pripojenia."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Current setting"
msgstr "Aktuálne nastavenie"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "These items were loaded from your company in SuperFaktúra. Choose which ones the documents from the shop use."
msgstr "Tieto údaje sme načítali z vašej firmy v SuperFaktúre. Vyberte, ktoré sa majú použiť na dokladoch z obchodu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Invoice number sequence"
msgstr "Číselník faktúr"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Proforma invoices"
msgstr "Zálohové faktúry"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Proforma invoice number sequence"
msgstr "Číselník zálohových faktúr"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Credit notes"
msgstr "Dobropisy"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Credit note number sequence"
msgstr "Číselník dobropisov"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "Logo"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Bank account"
msgstr "Bankový účet"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Bank account on invoices"
msgstr "Bankový účet na faktúrach"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Customers send payments for proforma invoices to this account. For automatic pairing, the account must be connected in SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Na tento účet budú zákazníci posielať platby za zálohové faktúry. Pri automatickom párovaní musí byť tento účet pripojený v SuperFaktúre."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "A customer from the Czech Republic gets the invoice in Czech, from Austria in German. For countries whose language SuperFaktúra does not support, the fallback language from the settings is used."
msgstr "Zákazník z Česka dostane faktúru po česky, z Rakúska po nemecky. Pre krajiny, ktorých jazyk SuperFaktúra nemá, sa použije náhradný jazyk z nastavení."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Proforma invoice, then invoice"
msgstr "Zálohová faktúra, potom faktúra"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Manually only"
msgstr "Len ručne"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "For each payment method enabled in your shop, we recommend which document to create and when. You can change the recommendation."
msgstr "Pri každom spôsobe platby zapnutom v obchode odporúčame, aký doklad a kedy vystaviť. Odporúčanie môžete zmeniť."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "No payment method is enabled in your shop. Enable them in WooCommerce > Settings > Payments and set up the documents later in the plugin settings."
msgstr "V obchode nie je zapnutý žiadny spôsob platby. Zapnite ich vo WooCommerce > Nastavenia > Platby a doklady nastavte neskôr v nastaveniach pluginu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Document"
msgstr "Doklad"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Create the proforma invoice in status"
msgstr "Zálohovú faktúru vystaviť v stave"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Create the invoice in status"
msgstr "Faktúru vystaviť v stave"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Payment type in SuperFaktúra"
msgstr "Spôsob platby v SuperFaktúre"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Create the invoice as paid"
msgstr "Vytvoriť faktúru ako uhradenú"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Why:"
msgstr "Prečo:"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Automatic pairing of bank transfers"
msgstr "Automatické párovanie platieb prevodom"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "When SuperFaktúra pairs a payment with the proforma invoice, it notifies the shop and the order is marked as paid. For this, enter these two values in SuperFaktúra once."
msgstr "Keď SuperFaktúra spáruje platbu so zálohovou faktúrou, dá vedieť obchodu a objednávka sa označí ako zaplatená. Na to treba raz vložiť tieto dva údaje do SuperFaktúry."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Callback URL"
msgstr "Callback URL"

#. translators: %1$s: link to SuperFaktúra settings, %2$s: field name, %3$s: field name.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "In SuperFaktúra, in the company you selected, open %1$s and enter them in the fields %2$s and %3$s."
msgstr "V SuperFaktúre vo vybranej firme otvorte %1$s a vložte ich do polí %2$s a %3$s."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "the settings"
msgstr "nastavenia"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Callback for payment"
msgstr "Callback pri úhradách platieb"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "This is set up in SuperFaktúra"
msgstr "V SuperFaktúre je to nastavené"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "If you do it later, the summary reminds you."
msgstr "Ak to urobíte neskôr, pripomenieme vám to v zhrnutí."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Recognized as personal pickup."
msgstr "Rozpoznané ako osobný odber."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Recognized as delivery to a pickup point or parcel locker."
msgstr "Rozpoznané ako doručenie na výdajné miesto alebo do boxu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Recognized as delivery by courier."
msgstr "Rozpoznané ako doručenie kuriérom."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Recognized as delivery by post."
msgstr "Rozpoznané ako doručenie poštou."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The delivery method appears on the invoice. We recommend it based on the shipping methods in your shop."
msgstr "Spôsob doručenia sa zobrazí na faktúre. Navrhujeme ho podľa spôsobov dopravy v obchode."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "On the invoice"
msgstr "Na faktúre"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Shipping item name"
msgstr "Názov poštovného"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Shipping item name on the invoice"
msgstr "Názov poštovného na faktúre"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "If it applies to you"
msgstr "Ak sa vás týka"

#. translators: %d: number of countries.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "Your shop also sells to %d other EU countries. Invoices to private customers there are created in the OSS scheme. Enable only if you are registered for OSS, or check with your accountant."
msgstr "Obchod predáva aj do %d ďalších krajín EÚ. Faktúry súkromným osobám v nich sa vystavia v režime OSS. Zapnite len vtedy, ak ste registrovaní do OSS, prípadne to overte s účtovníkom."

#. translators: %s: list of countries.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "Your shop also sells to %s. Invoices to private customers there are created in the OSS scheme. Enable only if you are registered for OSS, or check with your accountant."
msgstr "Obchod predáva aj do krajín: %s. Faktúry súkromným osobám v nich sa vystavia v režime OSS. Zapnite len vtedy, ak ste registrovaní do OSS, prípadne to overte s účtovníkom."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "What customers fill in at checkout and what they receive with the order."
msgstr "Čo zákazníci vyplnia v pokladni a čo dostanú s objednávkou."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Company details at checkout"
msgstr "Údaje firmy v pokladni"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The \"Buy as Business client\" checkbox with the company ID, tax ID and VAT number fields. The details appear on the invoice."
msgstr "Políčko „Fakturovať na firmu“ a polia IČO, DIČ a IČ DPH. Údaje sa prenesú na faktúru."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Validate the VAT number in VIES"
msgstr "Overovať IČ DPH vo VIES"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "No VAT for EU businesses with a valid VAT number"
msgstr "Bez DPH pre firmy z EÚ s platným IČ DPH"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Reverse charge. Enable if you sell to businesses in other EU countries and you are a VAT payer."
msgstr "Prenesenie daňovej povinnosti. Zapnite, ak predávate firmám v iných krajinách EÚ a ste platiteľ DPH."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "OSS for sales to private customers in other EU countries"
msgstr "OSS pre predaj súkromným osobám v iných krajinách EÚ"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Emails and order page"
msgstr "E-maily a stránka objednávky"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Invoice as a PDF attachment"
msgstr "Faktúra ako PDF príloha"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The document is attached to the emails the customer receives from the shop."
msgstr "Doklad sa priloží k e-mailom, ktoré zákazník dostane z obchodu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Invoice link after the order"
msgstr "Odkaz na faktúru po objednávke"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "On the \"Order received\" page."
msgstr "Na stránke „Objednávka prijatá“."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "QR code for payment on the invoice"
msgstr "Platobný QR kód na faktúre"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The customer pays a proforma invoice by scanning the code in their banking app."
msgstr "Zákazník zaplatí zálohovú faktúru naskenovaním kódu v bankovej aplikácii."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "These settings will be saved. All other settings stay as they are, you can find them in WooCommerce > Settings > SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Tieto nastavenia sa uložia. Ostatné nastavenia ostanú tak, ako sú, nájdete ich vo WooCommerce > Nastavenia > SuperFaktúra."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Automatic pairing is not set up in SuperFaktúra yet."
msgstr "Automatické párovanie ešte nie je nastavené v SuperFaktúre."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Without it, orders paid by bank transfer are not marked as paid automatically. The details are in the Payments step."
msgstr "Bez neho sa objednávky zaplatené prevodom samy neoznačia ako zaplatené. Údaje nájdete v kroku Platby."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Download a backup of the current settings"
msgstr "Stiahnuť zálohu aktuálnych nastavení"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Uložiť nastavenia"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Upraviť"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Done, invoicing is set up"
msgstr "Hotovo, fakturácia je nastavená"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The next order gets its documents according to these settings."
msgstr "Nasledujúca objednávka už dostane doklady podľa týchto nastavení."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "What we recommend next"
msgstr "Čo ešte odporúčame"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Set up automatic pairing in SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Nastavte automatické párovanie v SuperFaktúre."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Enter the Callback URL and Secret Key in the company settings, otherwise orders paid by bank transfer are not marked as paid automatically. You can find them in the plugin settings under Integration."
msgstr "Vložte Callback URL a Secret Key do nastavení firmy, inak sa objednávky zaplatené prevodom samy neoznačia ako zaplatené. Nájdete ich v nastaveniach pluginu v časti Integrácia."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Try one order."
msgstr "Vyskúšajte jednu objednávku."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Ideally with the payment method your customers use most. You can see the result in the order under Invoices and in the API log."
msgstr "Najlepšie so spôsobom platby, ktorý zákazníci používajú najčastejšie. Výsledok uvidíte v objednávke v časti Faktúry a v API logu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Go through the other settings."
msgstr "Prejdite si ďalšie nastavenia."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Accounting, cash registers and more options are in the plugin settings."
msgstr "Účtovníctvo, pokladne a ďalšie možnosti nájdete v nastaveniach pluginu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Open the plugin settings"
msgstr "Otvoriť nastavenia pluginu"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "Na túto akciu nemáte oprávnenie."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Fill in the API e-mail and API key."
msgstr "Vyplňte API e-mail a API kľúč."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-tools.php
msgid "Goes through the connection, documents, payments, shipping and checkout, and recommends settings for your payment and shipping methods. It shows the current settings and saves only what you confirm in the summary."
msgstr "Prevedie vás pripojením, dokladmi, platbami, dopravou a pokladňou a odporučí nastavenia pre vaše spôsoby platby a dopravy. Zobrazí aktuálne nastavenia a uloží len to, čo potvrdíte v zhrnutí."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "An invalid VAT number is not accepted."
msgstr "Neplatné IČ DPH sa neprijme."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "When the VIES service is unavailable, the order goes through."
msgstr "Ak služba VIES nie je dostupná, objednávka prejde."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "By customer country"
msgstr "Podľa krajiny zákazníka"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Check automatic pairing in SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Skontrolujte automatické párovanie v SuperFaktúre."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Check that automatic pairing is set up in SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Skontrolujte, či je v SuperFaktúre nastavené automatické párovanie."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Choose a company"
msgstr "Vyberte firmu"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Close the wizard"
msgstr "Zavrieť sprievodcu"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Copy the Callback URL"
msgstr "Kopírovať Callback URL"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Copy the Secret Key"
msgstr "Kopírovať Secret Key"

#. translators: %s: ID of an item in SuperFaktúra.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current setting (ID %s)"
msgstr "Aktuálne nastavenie (ID %s)"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Default language of SuperFaktúra"
msgstr "Predvolený jazyk SuperFaktúry"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Documents are created in the test account. Before you start selling, turn the sandbox off in the plugin settings."
msgstr "Doklady sa vytvárajú v testovacom účte. Predtým, ako začnete predávať, vypnite sandbox v nastaveniach pluginu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Don't specify"
msgstr "Neuvádzať"

#. translators: %s: link to the API page in SuperFaktúra.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "In SuperFaktúra under %s."
msgstr "V SuperFaktúre v časti %s."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Leave the wizard? Your choices will not be saved."
msgstr "Odísť zo sprievodcu? Vaše voľby sa neuložia."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Proforma invoice only"
msgstr "Len zálohová faktúra"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "Site language, otherwise the default language of SuperFaktúra"
msgstr "Jazyk webu, inak predvolený jazyk SuperFaktúry"

#. translators: %1$d: step number, %2$d: number of steps, %3$s: step title.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s"
msgstr "Krok %1$d z %2$d: %3$s"

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "SuperFaktúra did not accept the request. Check the e-mail, the API key, the account country and the Sandbox setting."
msgstr "SuperFaktúra požiadavku neprijala. Skontrolujte e-mail, API kľúč, krajinu účtu a nastavenie Sandbox."

#. translators: %s: order status name.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "The customer pays after placing the order. The proforma invoice gives them the payment details and SuperFaktúra pairs the incoming payment with it. With automatic pairing set up, the plugin then changes the order status to %s and creates the invoice."
msgstr "Zákazník platí až po objednávke. Zo zálohovej faktúry má údaje na platbu a SuperFaktúra s ňou prijatú platbu spáruje. Keď je automatické párovanie nastavené, plugin potom zmení stav objednávky na %s a vystaví faktúru."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The page has been open for too long. Reload it and try again."
msgstr "Stránka je otvorená príliš dlho. Obnovte ju a skúste to znova."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The payment and delivery types could not be loaded from SuperFaktúra."
msgstr "Spôsoby platby a dodania sa zo SuperFaktúry nepodarilo načítať."

#. translators: %s: order status name.
#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
#, php-format
msgid "The payment is made during checkout. The invoice is created when the paid order changes to %s, and it is marked as paid."
msgstr "Platba prebehne už pri objednávke. Faktúra sa vystaví, keď sa zaplatená objednávka zmení na stav %s, a rovno ako uhradená."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The plugin is already set up. Settings that will change are marked. If you might need the current settings again, download a backup first."
msgstr "Plugin je už nastavený. Nastavenia, ktoré sa zmenia, sú označené. Ak budete aktuálne nastavenia ešte potrebovať, najprv si stiahnite zálohu."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
msgid "The proforma invoice and the invoice would be created in the same status."
msgstr "Zálohová faktúra aj faktúra by vznikli v rovnakom stave."

#: includes/class-wc-sf-setup-wizard.php
